    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">You can take the Cast Action to conjure a Summon, a Being with HD: (your Level or lower), spending Mana to do so equal to its HD. You must conduct a 10-minute Ritual to determine your Summon before doing so. The following rules apply to your Summon:</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• You command it as an Action or by skipping your Move.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• It uses your Cast Skill for Checks and Saves.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• You must Focus on it, spending 1 Mana to do so each Turn. Otherwise, it is banished.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• When it is reduced to 0 HP, it is banished.</span></p>",
